    "views": "22.4k",
    "isFeatured": false,
    "excerpt": "An architectural masterclass on specifying luxury bath tubs, covering enameled cast iron, stone composites, subfloor joist engineering, and hydraulic plumbing standards.",
    "metaDescription": "Master the architectural specification of a luxury bath tub, focusing on spatial ergonomics, material physics, and structural requirements.",
    "heroImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507652313519-d4e9174996dd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85",
    "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507652313519-d4e9174996dd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85",
    "heroImageAlt": "A luxury white stone composite bath tub positioned in a bright modern architectural bathroom with floor to ceiling windows and brass fittings",
    "imageAlt": "A luxury white stone composite bath tub positioned in a bright modern architectural bathroom with floor to ceiling windows and brass fittings",
    "photographer": "Lumaa Home Editorial Curation",
